						NewString: 砍伐树木 - 木头以橡胶木形式产出。
					}

					9: {
						OldString: Powered saw - chops trees into Rubber Wood.
						NewString: 动力锯 - 将树木砍成橡胶木。
					}

					10: {
						OldString: Smashes walls and shapes blocks.
						NewString: 砸碎墙体和塑形方块。
					}

					11: {
						OldString: Melee weapon with slightly extended reach.
						NewString: 略微延长攻击距离的近战武器。
